--- not tried ---
A real >64 MiB backup against a real WebDAV or S3 server; the cap is unchanged,
so such a backup still can't be read through a sync — it is said too large
instead of the server's file being rebuilt over. docs/subsystems/sync-backup.md
says "empty, damaged or another app's format"; too-large is now its own error
and the page was not changed.

